Description:You control Blood Sun and a Forest, have not played a land this turn, and have Rugged Highlands, a Mountain, Kalonian Tusker and Rip-Clan Crasher in hand. You are at 20 life. End the turn with Kalonian Tusker on the battlefield and still at 20 life.
Rule:rulesguru-8ae9a5ca2af77ff9 | Under Blood Sun Rugged Highlands has no "enters tapped" replacement as it enters (CR 614.12, 614.1d), so it enters untapped, and its enters trigger does not trigger (CR 603.10, 611.3c): Highlands plus Forest pay for Kalonian Tusker, and no life is gained
